{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type EmbeddingModality = \"text\" | \"image\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3037","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:3037"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Input modalities an embedding model can accept. Unlike\n"},{"type":"link","href":"MediaPromptModality.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"MediaPromptModality"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'text'"},{"type":"text","value":" is listed explicitly because\ntext-only embedding models are the common case and the modality list\ndrives compile-time narrowing of "},{"type":"link","href":"EmbeddingInputItem.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"EmbeddingInputItem"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype EmbeddingModality = \"text\" | \"image\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3037](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3037)\n\nInput modalities an embedding model can accept. Unlike\n[MediaPromptModality](MediaPromptModality.md), `'text'` is listed explicitly because\ntext-only embedding models are the common case and the modality list\ndrives compile-time narrowing of [EmbeddingInputItem](EmbeddingInputItem.md).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: EmbeddingModality\ntitle: EmbeddingModality\n---\n\n```ts\ntype EmbeddingModality = \"text\" | \"image\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3037](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3037)\n\nInput modalities an embedding model can accept. Unlike\n[MediaPromptModality](MediaPromptModality.md), `'text'` is listed explicitly because\ntext-only embedding models are the common case and the modality list\ndrives compile-time narrowing of [EmbeddingInputItem](EmbeddingInputItem.md).\n"}
